sp.p:
My dear creature, don't make a noise about your rooms being too quiet;
                            they will look all the better in my eyes for being a little out of
                            sight. Are you the mistress of this inn, my dear?

That will be easy. Peregrine's character is trifling, but not vicious;
                            but I am first anxious to vindicate myself to Mr. Milford, if my Emily
                            will deign to accompany me.
